From: GameSidebar Fix <fix@gamesidebar.local>
Date: Fri, 12 Sep 2026 08:00:00 +0600
Subject: [PATCH] Game SideBar V2: keyboard Back double-tap collapse video
 landscape scroll passthrough fixes (Master Bugfix V2)

